  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>這個 SlashBlade 模組擴充功能引入了一把全新的劍——巴爾蒙克。這把劍源自遊戲《崩壞學園2》。</p>\n<p><strong>摘要：</strong><br>此擴充功能引入了「巴爾蒙克」，一把來自遊戲&nbsp;<em>《崩壞學園2》</em>的全新 SlashBlade。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
